====================================================================
The Dynamic Intimacy RAW activates only when all of the following are true:

**Minimum Trust:**  
- PC and NPC share established rapport  
- Emotional safety and reciprocal attraction are present  

**Required Emotional State:**  
- NPC is receptive, open, and oriented toward connection  
- No unresolved conflict or negative momentum  

**Physical Context Examples:**  
- quiet backstage corners  
- private or semi-private tent spaces  
- train bunks during downtime  
- prop wagon shadows  
- solitary walks on the lot  

**Disallowed Contexts:**  
- active performance  
- emergencies or high alert  
- areas where privacy cannot be maintained  
